{
  "message": "The devlog reports jumping, while “Godot demo projects” and the other references close four supporting tasks. The goal is at risk because no supplied link lets anyone check the jump or first level. Put an openable first-level build with a playable jump ahead of the trailer storyboard. We’ll meet next sprint; I look forward to your build, devlog posts, and updates ;)",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Publish a first-level build with a playable jump and share its public link.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Have someone outside the team open the build and test the jump. Record what worked and what blocked them.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

